  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Match**: Play a card from hand to match a card of the same suit in the field. If matched, take both. If no match, discard to the field.\n2. **Draw**: Draw the top card of the deck and match it with the field. Take any matches.\n3. **Forming Yaku**: If your captured cards form a combination (e.g., 3 Ribbons, or 'Ino-Shika-Cho'), you must decide: **Stop** (Score points) or **Koi-Koi** (Continue).",
    Player: "1. **Match**: Play a card from hand to match a card of the same suit in the field. If matched, take both. If no match, discard to the field.\n2. **Draw**: Draw the top card of the deck and match it with the field. Take any matches.\n3. **Forming Yaku**: If your captured cards form a combination (e.g., 3 Ribbons, or 'Ino-Shika-Cho'), you must decide: **Stop** (Score points) or **Koi-Koi** (Continue).",
    objective: "Form 'Yaku' (point combinations) and outscore your opponent over 6 or 12 rounds.",
    gameplay: "1. **Match**: Play a card from hand to match a card of the same suit in the field. If matched, take both. If no match, discard to the field.\n2. **Draw**: Draw the top card of the deck and match it with the field. Take any matches.\n3. **Forming Yaku**: If your captured cards form a combination (e.g., 3 Ribbons, or 'Ino-Shika-Cho'), you must decide: **Stop** (Score points) or **Koi-Koi** (Continue).",
    keyRules: [
      'Match by month (suit): play a card from hand to capture a same-month card from the table, or discard to table if no match.',
      'After play, draw one from stock; if it matches a table card capture both, else add to table.',
      'On forming a yaku, choose to stop and score or call Koi-Koi to continue; opponent forming yaku first doubles their score and zeros the caller.',
